abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis of the redistribution of divers (Gavia
  spp.) around offshore wind farms in the German North Sea,
  comparing a before period (2001-2008) with an after period
  (2017-2021) within a joint-likelihood log-Gaussian Cox process
  fitted with INLA and SPDE. The repository contains the model
  script, the sensitivity and validation analyses reported in the
  appendix, the verification scripts, and the input data. Code is
  released under MIT; the data in data/ are released under
  CC BY 4.0, see data/LICENSE-DATA.md.
